# Performance — Always Check

Full reference: `starter-kit/18-performance.md`. Target: LCP < 2.5s, INP < 200ms, CLS < 0.1, TTFB < 0.8s.

## Rules

- **Every new CMS read is `unstable_cache` + tagged** (`src/lib/cms/cache-tags.ts`, `revalidateNextCache.ts` pattern) — never call `payload.find`/`findGlobal` directly inside a page or component. This is the #1 TTFB regression risk.
- **`depth: 0`** on Payload queries unless a relation genuinely needs inline population.
- **`next/image`** for all content images, `priority` only on the LCP image, always set `sizes`.
- **No new font without checking `18-performance.md`** — self-hosted (`next/font`) only, never a CDN `<link>`. Every added font is an LCP/CLS risk.
- **`'use client'`** scoped to the smallest interactive island — never promote a whole page to client for one widget.
- **Animation**: `transform`/`opacity` only for continuous/frequent animation — see `animation-standards.mdc`. Never animate `width`/`height`/`top`/`left`/`margin` on a loop.
- **Third-party scripts**: `next/script` with explicit `strategy`, never a raw `<script>` tag.
- **Heavy/rarely-used client code**: `next/dynamic` with `ssr: false` where appropriate.

## Review gate

- [ ] No uncached Payload call added
- [ ] `depth: 0` unless relation genuinely needed
- [ ] LCP image has `priority`, others lazy
- [ ] No new external font link
- [ ] `'use client'` boundary is minimal
- [ ] `pnpm run analyze` checked if a new client-side dependency was added

